{"id":"f74fb6d7b9fd5e2e","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-cfg-code-effective-syntax.md","title":"CFG 代码单射且语法合法性可判定","display":"thm-cfg-code-effective-syntax — CFG 代码单射且语法合法性可判定","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-cfg-code-effective-syntax","aliases":["73-thm-cfg-code-effective-syntax"],"display":"thm-cfg-code-effective-syntax — CFG 代码单射且语法合法性可判定","depends_on":["[[73-df-canonical-cfg-binary-code]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§9.5, print pp. 413–418; PDF pp. 435–440; local decidable syntax infrastructure","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":9},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-cfg-code-effective-syntax"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-cfg-code-effective-syntax</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cfg-code-effective-syntax — CFG 代码单射且语法合法性可判定"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3d01ee2a38f6e35\" href=\"?note=a3d01ee2a38f6e35\" title=\"73-df-canonical-cfg-binary-code\">73-df-canonical-cfg-binary-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§9.5, print pp. 413–418; PDF pp. 435–440; local decidable syntax infrastructure"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,H\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}\">\\(G,H\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CFGCODES}\">\\(\\mathsf{CFGCODES}\\)</span> 为规范代码的像。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G)=\\operatorname{CFGCode}(H)\\Longrightarrow G=H.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G)=\\operatorname{CFGCode}(H)\\Longrightarrow G=H.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CFGCODES}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G):G\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{CFGCODES}\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CFGCODES}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G):G\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{CFGCODES}\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>顺序读取自定界整数、集合列表、规则数和相应数量的规则列表；检查无剩余位、严格排序、变量终结符分离、开始符号成员关系以及产生式类型。每项只处理有限输入，故总会停机。这里判断的是语法，不是文法语言是否相等或是否歧义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-canonical-cfg-binary-code","status":"resolved","id":"a3d01ee2a38f6e35","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-canonical-cfg-binary-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","status":"resolved","id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G,H\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{CFGCODES}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G)=\\operatorname{CFGCode}(H)\\Longrightarrow G=H.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{CFGCODES}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{CFGCode}(G):G\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{CFGCODES}\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}.","display":true}],"bytes":1463,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-220","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-cfg-code-effective-syntax|CFG 代码单射且语法合法性可判定]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["a3d01ee2a38f6e35","004d4e2ba3fdd14e"]}